{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lUa8IQTHS3iAe0CVK4Ryzg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:43.246306+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lUa8IQTHS3iAe0CVK4Ryzg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/Okddia0ceFeceaeuDaxJdOYv1gOpkwuugBuKRrNJpxwIB8LU6zcrN9jmR6Ah4yqK0WOYEZTnYIwhlicFC56CI9nvzzEkoLFMDdEdNAQxHtNOI/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>为促进物理专业优秀学生之间的交流，华中科技大学物理学院与国家精密重力测量科学中心诚邀全国高校热爱物理的优秀学子相聚2026年物理学院暨国家精密重力测量科学中心优秀大学生夏令营！本次夏令营将为同学们搭建一个全方位了解华中科技大学物理学院科研特色、人才培养体系的平台。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>一、活动安排</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>夏令营预计时间为2026年7月5日-7月7日</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>夏令营拟招收120人左右</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>二、申请与入营</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1、申请条件</span></span></p><p><span><span>（1）全国高校物理及相关学科2023级在读本科生；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）本科期间学习成绩优秀，前5学期总评成绩在年级前列，对物理相关专业有浓厚兴趣；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（4）英语需达到国家四级及以上水平；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、申请流程及入营</span></span></p><p><span><span>（1）报名时间：6月8日-6月21日</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）报名方法：</span></span></p><p><span><span>有报名意向的同学请于6月18日前加入华科物理2027级招生咨询QQ群：815803067或834627210，6月18日将在群里线上开展科研团队介绍，助力各位同学提前了解学院基本情况。</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请人于2026年6月21日24点之前登录夏令营系统报名http://yanzhao.hust.edu.cn/，按照要求提交有关材料，操作说明见文件：《华中科技大学夏令营报名系统操作说明》（附件3）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>同时，请务必扫描下方二维码或登录腾讯文档网址填写个人信息汇总表（https://docs.qq.com/form/page/DRVJreEdzaGJvZmpB）。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Okddia0ceFedRXFZoRHUsicSWP09Y2zib8iaacxjpH6Tic9uLPCaS49kCicNwvQlnO0Kl1stzsV01XVqeXNKIPs0F6tb3FhMwxgwbh6v3SfEwQTNE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>申请人提交的信息必须准确、有效，凡提供虚假信息的，一经查实，将取消申请资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）入营方式：</span></span></p><p><span><span>接收的夏令营学员名单将于2026年6月25日左右在网上公布并通过夏令营系统通知本人，届时未接到入营通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>三、申请所需材料</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>①《华中科技大学物理学院暨国家精密重力测量科学中心2026年优秀大学生夏令营营员申请表》（见附件1）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>②个人简历；</span></span></p><p><span><span>③两位副教授（或相当职称）以上的专家推荐书2份（见附件2）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>④加盖学校或院系公章的在校学习成绩单和专业排名证明；</span></span></p><p><span><span>⑤英语水平证明（包括国家英语四、六级考试成绩或TOEFL/GRE/GMAT/雅思成绩等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>⑥其他能体现本人科研能力的相关材料，如已发表论文、已获得专利、各类获奖证书或原创性工作成果等。</span></span></p><p><span><span>注意：①②③④⑤为必要材料，其他材料可以根据自身情况选择性提交。其中①②③按顺序扫描合并成一个PDF文档，并在夏令营系统中上传至《其他材料5》部分。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>四、其他事项</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1、参加夏令营的同学须遵守学院相关规定，严格按照统一安排进行学习和活动；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、参营同学夏令营期间由学院统一安排食宿（武汉高校的营员不提供住宿）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3、学院为参营同学报销高校所在地往返武汉的高铁二等座或硬卧标准，乘坐飞机报销金额上限不超过前述交通费用。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>五、联系方式</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>联系单位：物理学院学生工作组、科研与研究生科</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：027-87543980、027-87559495</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>附件下载：</span></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lUa8IQTHS3iAe0CVK4Ryzg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：华中科技大学物理学院2026年优秀大学生夏令营营员申请表.docx</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lUa8IQTHS3iAe0CVK4Ryzg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：专家推荐书.doc</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lUa8IQTHS3iAe0CVK4Ryzg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件3：华中科技大学夏令营报名系统操作说明.docx</a></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><span><br/></span></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><span><br/></span></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>——华中科技大学物理学院团委学生会——</span></span></p><p><span><span>新闻宣传中心 </span><span><span>PhyHust</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><span><br/></span></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>编辑 | 吴睿晨</span></span></p><p><span><span>校对 | 陶一铭</span></span></p><p><span><span>审核 | 姜宗显</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><span><br/></span></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Okddia0ceFeepnbJ1meONl20ll48NnyqjTaPyC2DXrhFn1nibTnOjwE8fFWZ9PXozrS8H6IM4whtENia78nxV2QnBqFeQAxECvKY78N0pHzcq0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"47b4131c54a3e4f183afdfb7b786aa9fbb429e70c2798b4aabbef4b6ace008d6","textLength":1327,"sourceSha256":"0e3b8bba3acd90ef1ea3deba1c4881897e3b618118f12dbf66340d458ccfa1ba","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-74879136c3aede9017cf","title":"2026年华中科技大学物理学院暨国家精密重力测量科学中心优秀大学生夏令营活动的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:43.246306+00:00"}
